            "mimeType": "text/html; charset=UTF-8",
            "size": 785,
            "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Storage Partitioning Test Page</title>\n\n    <script src='/helpers/idb-wrapper.js' defer></script>\n    <script src='/helpers/uuidv4.min.js'></script>\n    <script src='./helpers/tests.js'></script>\n    <script src='./helpers/common.js'></script>\n    <script src='./main.js' defer></script>\n    <link href='./style.css' rel='stylesheet'></link>\n    <link id=\"favicon\" rel=\"shortcut icon\" type=\"image/png\" href=\"\" /> <!-- Used by favicon cache test -->\n</head>\n<body>\n    <p><a href=\"../../\">[Home]</a> ↣ <a href=\"../\">[Privacy Protections Tests]</a> ↣ <strong>[Storage Partitioning Test Page]</strong></p>\n\n    <p>This page will determine whether various storage APIs are parititoned or blocked across origins.</p>\n    <p>NOTE: These tests will return incorrect results if:\n        <ul>\n            <li>you have multiple copies of the test page open</li>\n            <li>you run the tests after force reloading the page, as this <a href=\"https://web.dev/service-worker-lifecycle/#shift-reload\">bypasses</a> Service Workers</li>\n        </ul>\n    </p>\n\n    <p id='warning'></p>\n    <p><button id='run'>Run Tests</button></p>\n\n    <div id='tests' hidden>\n        <p id='tests-summary'></p><button id='toggle-details'>Show Detailed Results</button>\n        <ul id='tests-details'>\n        </ul>\n    </div>\n\n    <p><button id='download' disabled>Download the result</button></p>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n"
